      "created_at": "2014-02-05T01:56:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Over in the&nbsp;wiki thread, Omnitron-X's Reset art was mentioned in passing. There was a suggestion it was Legacy fighting Voss; but couldn't it be Iron Legacy fighting Sky as easily? The Legacy figure looks somehow armored to me, and is Voss that big?</p><p>On another note, what's up with Defensive Blast? Anyone recognize those figures, or will we see them in the next expansion? Four of them are getting hit by the effects of an Elemental Exochassis, but what's up with the spike through the one character in the background?</p>",
