      "raw": "<p>Gene Bound Ion Lancers</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But, no. Those are not Gene Bound Ion Lancers. Those are the same unknowns&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:k-n-y-f-e\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(85, 85, 170); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">K.N.Y.F.E</a><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">&#39;s Incidental Contact,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:the-argent-adept\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(85, 85, 170); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">The Argent Adept</a><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">&#39;s Syncopated Onslaught,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:omnitron-x\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(85, 85, 170); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">Omnitron-X</a><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">&#39;s Defensive Blast,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/heroes:the-visionary\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(85, 85, 170); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">The Visionary</a><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">&#39;s Cerebral Hemorrhage.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">Their armor is different than the Ion Lancer (Color, shape) they aren&#39;t showing their midrif&#39;s (as the ion lancers are) and their helms actually have a different shape - you can see a close up of an ion lancer helm on Expat&#39;s Unload, which is different than these guys.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">These guys are my now favorite &#39;Who are they!!&#39; and I can&#39;t wait to see if their space armor like appearance leads them to show up in WotC</span></p>",
